    "Mars has the tallest mountain in the solar system, a huge volcano called Olympus Mons.": "8ae9e3dbbe1c.mp3",
    "It has two small moons, Phobos and Deimos.": "3650b0a5f69a.mp3",
    "Right now, robots sent from Earth are rolling around on Mars, looking for signs that water once flowed there.": "501469364ce1.mp3",
