    "And the Great Red Spot is a giant storm, bigger than the whole Earth, that has been raging for hundreds of years.": "f3d125bdd283.mp3",
    "Even though it is so big, Jupiter spins faster than any other planet: a day there lasts less than ten hours.": "0f815c7c0881.mp3",
