    "So it rolls around the Sun like a ball rolling on the floor.": "c9f60e9d7e0c.mp3",
    "One year on Uranus lasts eighty-four years, and at each pole there are forty-two years of light, followed by forty-two years of darkness.": "a45e89fc605a.mp3",
    "And this is Neptune, the planet farthest from the Sun.": "3d45386e1ae4.mp3",
    "It is dark blue, very cold and very dark.": "9784869ad75d.mp3",
    "Neptune has the strongest winds in the solar system, faster than a jet plane.": "73f51d73ff4b.mp3",
    "Because it is so far away, its path around the Sun is very long, and it also moves slowly.": "6115dfaf5b8d.mp3",
    "One trip around takes about a hundred and sixty-five years!": "7827b7e26081.mp3",
    "Its big moon, Triton, goes around it in the opposite direction, which is very rare.": "4f7b7fb93f75.mp3",
    "And this is Pluto!": "ff69b14ab72b.mp3",
