    "It is very small, even smaller than our Moon, and in its neighborhood there are lots of other icy worlds like it.": "11330afd18d2.mp3",
    "Pluto is so far away that one trip around the Sun takes it two hundred and forty-eight years.": "4a381fc83484.mp3",
    "Its orbit is squished and very tilted, and sometimes it is even closer to the Sun than Neptune.": "3745016e2a5e.mp3",
    "In two thousand and fifteen, a spacecraft called New Horizons flew by it, and found mountains of ice and a bright area shaped like a giant heart.": "286dd0e96f74.mp3",
    "That’s the end of our tour of the solar system!": "122454755a02.mp3",
    "Now it’s your turn to explore.": "716210573812.mp3",
